    "title": "ROAD CLOSURE: Old Wilson Road in Holmes County to be closed Dec. 11-12 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jalon Grant ,\n3 hours ago\nMISSISSIPPI (KTVE/KARD) — To allow Mississippi Department of Transportation crews to work, both directions of Old Wilson Road at Interstate 55 and both directions of Franklin Road at Interstate 55 in Holes County will be closed beginning at 8 a.m. Thursday, December 11, until Friday, December 12, 2025, at 5 p.m. for bridge inspection and repair.\nPhoto courtesy of MDOT\nAccording to MDOT, drivers will have to use an alternate route during the closure. For more information on the closure, visit the links below.\nFor more INFORMATION CLICK HERE For more information CLICK HERE For more INFORMATION CLICK HERE Copyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTVE - myarklamiss.com.",
